WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.359 --> 00:00:08.509
Speaker 1: We continue to explore the overlap
between extreme right wing ism and mental

00:00:08.509 --> 00:00:09.980
illness.

00:00:09.980 --> 00:00:16.240
And this is a link that we can also find on
the extremes on the left as well.

00:00:16.240 --> 00:00:19.400
But it's particularly notable lately on the
right.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:24.910
And I have for you today, I'm going to present
to you a new character.

00:00:24.910 --> 00:00:27.900
This is Susan Dilemmas.

00:00:27.900 --> 00:00:31.450
Susan Dilemmas is a New Hampshire state representative.

00:00:31.450 --> 00:00:37.870
She, in the wake of the forthcoming Roe v
Wade decision from the Supreme Court that

00:00:37.870 --> 00:00:39.870
we learned about last week.

00:00:39.870 --> 00:00:46.430
Protests broke out all over the country and
Representative Susan Delmas showed up at the

00:00:46.430 --> 00:00:52.910
New Hampshire State House and started screaming
at the top of her lungs, I'm a murderer.

00:00:52.910 --> 00:00:56.370
I murdered my own baby.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:59.790
And this is serious and tragic.

00:00:59.790 --> 00:01:03.650
And it also looks like a Saturday Night Live
skit, quite frankly.

00:01:03.650 --> 00:01:04.650
It's both.

00:01:04.650 --> 00:01:09.590
It's sad and it's endlessly hysterical in
a way.

00:01:09.590 --> 00:01:10.900
So I'm going to play this for you.

00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:16.100
She showed up and she started admonishing
the pro-choice protesters, calling them murderers

00:01:16.100 --> 00:01:18.420
and calling herself a murderer.

00:01:18.420 --> 00:01:24.890
Check this out.

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:27.330
So now she's screaming, shame on all of you.

00:01:27.330 --> 00:01:34.200
But then she turns the anger inward.

00:01:34.200 --> 00:01:44.820
You your.

00:01:44.820 --> 00:01:50.130
I.

00:01:50.130 --> 00:01:55.270
So I mean, it's impossible not to laugh at
the absurdity of this.

00:01:55.270 --> 00:02:00.580
And also, tragically, she seems like a very
unwell person.

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:04.060
And this is a real challenge we have right
now.

00:02:04.060 --> 00:02:08.220
We have to be sympathetic.

00:02:08.220 --> 00:02:13.730
To severe illness, mental illness, without
diagnosing anyone ever.

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:15.860
Of course we never do that.

00:02:15.860 --> 00:02:20.580
And at the same time realized that there is
political strength behind this nutter.

00:02:20.580 --> 00:02:22.320
I'll give you another example.

00:02:22.320 --> 00:02:28.090
We looked yesterday at this anti-vax stuff
where Michael Flynn and some guy named Clay,

00:02:28.090 --> 00:02:35.730
I believe his name was were talking about
how there are how do I even explain this?

00:02:35.730 --> 00:02:43.090
There are particles injected into the body
in the COVID vaccine, which then are which

00:02:43.090 --> 00:02:51.690
contain Marburg virus, which is a filovirus
in the family of Ebola they inject you with.

00:02:51.690 --> 00:02:59.590
It's almost like standby particles of the
Marburg virus and then a 5G signal pulsed

00:02:59.590 --> 00:03:06.440
three times in a minute will activate the
particles which are on standby, and then you

00:03:06.440 --> 00:03:10.210
will get Marburg virus.

00:03:10.210 --> 00:03:11.210
That's so crazy.

00:03:11.210 --> 00:03:12.480
You have to laugh at that.

00:03:12.480 --> 00:03:13.480
That's absurd.

00:03:13.480 --> 00:03:14.480
It's just it's comical.

00:03:14.480 --> 00:03:16.989
It's a comical conspiracy theory.

00:03:16.989 --> 00:03:22.250
But also, we have to recognize that seems
like mental illness.

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:24.300
And it's a tough thing to do.

00:03:24.300 --> 00:03:26.640
I don't know what else can be said.

00:03:26.640 --> 00:03:31.060
But whatever Susan Dilemmas went through or
is going through.

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.610
Um.

00:03:32.610 --> 00:03:34.160
Hopefully she can get the help she needs.

00:03:34.160 --> 00:03:42.769
I mean, I'm struggling with how to even say
this, but a new hero, I guess, of the.

00:03:42.769 --> 00:03:43.769
Anti-choice movement.

